<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech units win China hydro power deal.</title>
<headline>VA Tech units win China hydro power deal.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two units of blue-chip engineering group VA Technologie AG, Elin Energieversorgung and Voest-Alpine MCE, have received weighty contracts for a Chinese hydroelectric power plant, the group said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Elin will provide electrical equipment and VA MCE four bulb turbines for the Da Yuan Du plant in Hunan province. The contract is worth around 360 million schillings.</p>
<p>The plant is intended to meet the rapidly growing energy needs of the province, providing 130 megawatts of power.</p>
</text>
